<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PrimeVest - Main</title>
    <!-- Gagamit tayo ng Tailwind CSS para maging maganda at modernong investment site agad -->
    <script src="https://jsdelivr.net"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-950 text-white font-sans flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-screen p-6 text-center">

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl">
        <!-- Logo/Icon -->
        <div class="text-5xl mb-4">💰</div>
        
        <!-- Title at Subtitle -->
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 tracking-tight">PrimeVest</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2 px-4">
            Maligayang pagdating sa iyong ligtas at mabilis na platform para sa pagpapalago ng iyong pondo.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature List (Maliit na Impormasyon) -->
        <div class="my-6 space-y-2 text-left bg-gray-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800/50">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-300">✅ <span class="font-semibold text-white">Manual GCash:</span> Madaling cash-in at cash-out.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-300">✅ <span class="font-semibold text-white">Secure Data:</span> Protektado ng Supabase.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-300">✅ <span class="font-semibold text-white">Live Tracking:</span> Kita mo ang iyong ROI sa dashboard.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ang Main Button papunta sa Dashboard -->
        <a href="dashboard.html" class="block w-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold p-4 rounded-xl text-base transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 active:scale-98">
            🚀 Pumasok sa Dashboard
        </a>
        
        <!-- Footer info -->
        <p class="text-xxs text-gray-500 mt-6">© 2026 PrimeVest Website. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
